{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "E: y^2 + y = x^3 - x\n  a-invariants: [0, 0, 1, -1, 0]\n  b2, b4, b6, b8: 0, -2, 1, -1\n  c4, c6: 48, -216\n  discriminant: 37\n  j-invariant: 110592/37\n  minimal model: y^2 + y = x^3 - x  ([u, r, s, t] = [1, 0, 0, 0])\n  minimal discriminant: 37\n  conductor: 37\n  p = 37: I1, v(disc) = 1, f = 1, c_p = 1, non-split multiplicative\n  Tamagawa product: 1\n  torsion: trivial  [Nagell-Lutz, order bounded by gcd #E(F_p) = 1]\n  rank: >= 1 (no rational 2-torsion: no descent bound here; see the analytic rank)\n  generator: (0, 0), height 0.051111408240\n  regulator: 0.051111408240\n  saturated at every prime <= 7 (reductions mod p; at 2 the descent map when the 2-torsion is rational)\n  periods: w1 = 2.99345864623196, w2 = 0 +2.45138938198679i; Omega = 5.98691729246392 (2 components)\n  root number: -1 (functional equation mismatch 0.0e+00 for it, 1.4e-02 for the other sign)\n  a_n: 1 -2 -3 2 -2 6 -1 0 6 4 -5 -6 -2 2 6 -4 0 -12 0 -4\n  L'(E, 1) = 0.305999773834  (truncation error <= 1.0e-13, 78 terms)\n  analytic rank: 1\n  so the rank is 1 (Gross-Zagier, Kolyvagin: L'(E, 1) != 0)\n  BSD: #Sha_an = L^(1)(1)/1! * #T^2 / (Omega * R * prod c_p) = 1.000000000\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "elliptic", "ucas": "ec [0,0,1,-1,0]", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "ec", "ainvs": "[0, 0, 1, -1, 0]", "discriminant": "37", "j": "110592/37", "minimal": "[0, 0, 1, -1, 0]", "conductor": "37", "local": [{"p": "37", "kodaira": "I1", "f": 1, "cp": 1, "reduction": "non-split multiplicative"}], "torsion": "0", "rank_lo": 1, "generators": [{"point": "(0, 0)", "height": 0.05111140823996884}], "regulator": 0.05111140823996884, "omega": 5.986917292463918, "root_number": -1, "analytic_rank": 1, "sha_an": 0.9999999999999991}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "E: y^2 + y = x^3 - x\n  a-invariants: [0, 0, 1, -1, 0]\n  b2, b4, b6, b8: 0, -2, 1, -1\n  c4, c6: 4