{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 12, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "n is congruent iff E_n has positive rank, E_n: y^2 = x^3 - 25*x\n  torsion: Z/2 x Z/2, generated by (-5, 0) (0, 0)  [Nagell-Lutz, order bounded by gcd #E(F_p) = 4]\n  torsion points: O (-5, 0) (0, 0) (5, 0)\n  2-isogeny descent: |Sel(phi)| = 2^2, |Sel(phi')| = 2^1; images of points found 2^2, 2^1\n  rank: 1 (proved by 2-isogeny descent)\n  generator: (-4, -6), height 1.899482172532\n  regulator: 1.899482172532\n  saturated at every prime <= 7 (reductions mod p; at 2 the descent map when the 2-torsion is rational)\n5 is congruent: the right triangle with sides\n  a = 3/2\n  b = 20/3\n  c = 41/6\n  check: a^2 + b^2 = c^2 and a b / 2 = 5 (exact)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 12, "ok": true, "cmd": "congruent", "ucas": "congruent 5", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "congruent", "torsion": "Z/2 x Z/2", "rank_lo": 1, "rank_hi": 1, "generators": [{"point": "(-4, -6)", "height": 1.8994821725317956}], "regulator": 1.8994821725317956, "n": 5, "congruent": true, "a": "3/2", "b": "20/3", "c": "41/6"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "triangle", "points": 1, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "a^2 + b^2 = c^2 and ab/2 = n, exactly"}], "files": [], "text": "n is congruent iff E_n has positive rank, E_n: y^2 = x^3 - 25*x\n  torsion: Z/2 x Z/2, generated by (-5, 0) (0, 0)  [Nagell-Lutz, order bounded by gcd #E(F_p) = 4]\n  torsion points: O (-5, 0) (0, 0) (5, 0)\n  2-isogeny descent: |Sel(phi)| = 2^2, |Sel(phi')| = 2^1; images of points found 2^2, 2^1\n  rank: 1 (proved by 2-isogeny descent)\n  generator: (-4, -6), height 1.899482172532\n  regulator: 1.899482172532\n  saturated at every prime <= 7 (reductions mod p; at 2 the descent map when the 2-torsion is rational)\n5 is congruent: the right triangle with sides\n  a = 3/2\n  b = 20/3\n  c = 41/6\n  check: a^2 + b^2 = c^2 and a b / 2 = 5 (exact)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 13, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "7 as a sum of two rational cubes: x^3 + y^3 = 7 z^3 with x, y, z != 0, x, y > 0\nequation: x^3 + y^3 - 7*z^3 = 0\na plane cubic in P^2 (homogeneous of degree 3 in x, y, z)\nrational points found by search: 5; base point P0 = (-1 : 1 : 0), a flex: its tangent line to infinity and P0 to O give Weierstrass form directly\nWeierstrass form: y^2 - 1/147*y = x^3 - 1/64827\nminimal model E: y^2 + y = x^3 - 331, by [u, r, s, t] = [1/21, 0, 0, 32/9261]\ntorsion: trivial (1 points)\nrank >= 1 (no 2-torsion: no descent bound here)\ngenerator P1 = (21, 94), height 0.2980919267\nsaturated at the primes <= 7\nsolution 1, from -2*P1:\n  x = 4\n  y = 5\n  z = 3\n  check: substituted into the equation, both sides are equal\npoints tried: 4 (0 at exceptional points of the maps)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 13, "ok": true, "cmd": "cubesum", "ucas": "cubesum 7 positive", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "cubesum", "polynomial": "x^3 + y^3 - 7*z^3", "curve": "[0, 0, 1, 0, -331]", "rank_lo": 1, "solutions": [{"x": "4", "y": "5", "z": "3", "from": "-2*P1"}], "solutions_found": 1}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 1, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "the solution substituted into the original equation: both sides equal (exact)"}, {"kind": "maps", "points": 1, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "the point mapped back to the curve model and forward again gives the same point"}], "files": [], "text": "7 as a sum of two rational cubes: x^3 + y^3 = 7 z^3 with x, y, z != 0, x, y > 0\nequation: x^3 + y^3 - 7*z^3 = 0\na plane cubic in P^2 (homogeneous of degree 3 in x, y, z)\nrational points found by search: 5; base point P0 = (-1 : 1 : 0), a flex: its tangent line to infinity and P0 to O give Weierstrass form directly\nWeierstrass form: y^2 - 1/147*y = x^3 - 1/64827\nminimal model E: y^2 + y = x^3 - 331, by [u, r, s, t] = [1/21, 0, 0, 32/9261]\ntorsion: tri